•	Defines an upper pressure limit for the analysis
Required Pressure
•	Sets a target pressure threshold for specific evaluation scenarios
New Pressure Threshold
•	Allows creation and management of custom pressure threshold profiles
•	Supports scenario-based and regulatory-specific analysis
Check End Time
•	Defines the simulation duration for each failure scenario
